  "_comment": "publish_scrub.py applies 'replacements' (in order, regex, case-insensitive) then fails on any 'forbidden' pattern. Patterns are regex-encoded so this config itself never contains the raw vendor/client names. This file is exempt from its own scrubbing (enforced in publish_scrub.py).",
